WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.807 --> 00:00:03.466
(pop music)

00:00:03.466 --> 00:00:07.074
- [Man] When a bag is made from
a billboard it has a story.

00:00:07.074 --> 00:00:09.117
It's creative, it's bold.

00:00:09.117 --> 00:00:12.449
Every bag is giving back
and it's being eco-friendly.

00:00:12.449 --> 00:00:14.782
(pop music)

00:00:15.869 --> 00:00:17.366
I was working in
advertising and I saw that

00:00:17.366 --> 00:00:18.836
all the billboards that were going up

00:00:18.836 --> 00:00:20.860
in essence were going to the landfill.

00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:23.246
Most people don't know that
billboards are made of vinyl

00:00:23.246 --> 00:00:25.168
and it can be turned into something else.

00:00:25.168 --> 00:00:28.407
And so, I thought, “Let's create a business that's

00:00:28.407 --> 00:00:30.845
solely based on billboards.”

00:00:30.845 --> 00:00:32.665
(gentle music)

00:00:32.665 --> 00:00:34.034
On any given month, we get close to around

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:36.371
10,000 pounds of billboards

00:00:36.371 --> 00:00:38.476
that we turn into product.

00:00:38.476 --> 00:00:40.008
Once that billboard
goes up, it's usually up

00:00:40.008 --> 00:00:41.522
for a period of about four weeks

00:00:41.522 --> 00:00:44.478
is what a typical campaign
is on the street for.

00:00:44.478 --> 00:00:45.778
(gentle music)

00:00:45.778 --> 00:00:47.729
It's then shipped to our facility here.

00:00:47.729 --> 00:00:50.376
We sort it, we cut it, and
send it to the manufacturer

00:00:50.376 --> 00:00:53.322
where they do the final sewing
and cleaning of the product.

00:00:53.322 --> 00:00:55.011
(gentle music)

00:00:55.011 --> 00:00:57.095
- [Man] We're able to
take a billboard that had

00:00:57.095 --> 00:00:58.100
one purpose

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:00.956
and then reuse it to make something else.

00:01:00.956 --> 00:01:03.280
(gentle music)

00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:05.242
My brother and myself
are both huge surfers.

00:01:05.242 --> 00:01:07.829
And we kind of felt like
the surfing community

00:01:07.829 --> 00:01:10.115
loves bright colors.

00:01:10.115 --> 00:01:12.769
And billboard vinyl is
actually very durable.

00:01:12.769 --> 00:01:14.435
(gentle music)

00:01:14.435 --> 00:01:16.345
It's a thick material.

00:01:16.345 --> 00:01:18.416
It's waterproof, it's mildew proof.

00:01:18.416 --> 00:01:21.140
So, it's actually the perfect material for

00:01:21.140 --> 00:01:22.977
a surfboard bag.

00:01:22.977 --> 00:01:24.948
After that we expanded into backpacks,

00:01:24.948 --> 00:01:26.413
duffle bags, wallets.

00:01:26.413 --> 00:01:28.068
- [Alec] Fanny packs, hip packs,

00:01:28.068 --> 00:01:29.480
snowboard bags.

00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:30.445
Every product's different.

00:01:30.445 --> 00:01:32.030
Every product's one of a kind.

00:01:32.030 --> 00:01:34.364
Each piece that we make

00:01:34.364 --> 00:01:35.963
is unlike anything before it.

00:01:35.963 --> 00:01:38.044
(gentle music)

00:01:38.044 --> 00:01:40.461
Our playground for all of this
is based in the environment.

00:01:40.461 --> 00:01:42.818
Whether it's the mountains, the rivers,

00:01:42.818 --> 00:01:45.947
the ocean, it's something
that we, in essence

00:01:45.947 --> 00:01:49.352
have a responsibility
to maintain and sustain.

00:01:49.352 --> 00:01:51.935
(gentle music)

